# Photo Frame schedule — CLIENT frame (display only).
# This frame pulls the primary's prepared playlist + cache; it does NOT scan the
# NAS or build playlists. Install with:  crontab deploy/crontab.client
#
# Pull runs after the primary's 07:15 daily rebuild. Nightly blank/wake are the
# same as the primary.
#
# m h  dom mon dow   command
0  7   *   *   *     /home/pi/wake.sh                                     # power the panel back on
20 7   *   *   *     /home/pi/sync.sh >> /home/pi/sync.log 2>&1           # pull the primary's playlist + cache
30 22  *   *   *     /home/pi/sleep.sh                                    # power the panel off at night
# OS updates: unattended-upgrades (security only) — see deploy/apt/.
